{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46   二期生   宮崎県出身\nまつりちゃんこと松田里奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めまして、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢Sakurazaka46 ARENA TOUR 2026 -What’s lonesome?-｣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6都市12公演、無事完走することができましたーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お越しいただいた皆様、配信をご覧いただいた皆様、本当にありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まず！！\n楽しかったーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesありがとうーーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなと同じ場所で同じ時間を共有することってとっても幸せだーー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このツアーでたくさんの幸せをいただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このライブが皆さんにとっても、心に残るものになっていたらと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesには櫻坂がついてるよーーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もBuddiesがいるから頑張れてるよっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesだいすきだよーーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobDHYoOG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回も二期生で撮るべく、すぐさま大きな声で呼びかけ、集めました。\n無事撮れました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46